[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11580.23, "timestamp": "03:13:00", "text": "确切地。游戏仍将继续进行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11582.95, "timestamp": "03:13:02", "text": "那里。不过，这段对话……是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11585.21, "timestamp": "03:13:05", "text": "我们会继续下去。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11586.389, "timestamp": "03:13:06", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11589.03, "timestamp": "03:13:09", "text": "我的天啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11592.71, "timestamp": "03:13:12", "text": "我一直在关注你的推特。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11596.309, "timestamp": "03:13:16", "text": "你做的3D效果太酷了！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11598.95, "timestamp": "03:13:18", "text": "搅拌机相关的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11601.429, "timestamp": "03:13:21", "text": "谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11606.63, "timestamp": "03:13:26", "text": "是的。就像3D效果一样，这真是意想不到的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11609.99, "timestamp": "03:13:29", "text": "嗯，就像一头扎进去，因为就像一开始我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11611.67, "timestamp": "03:13:31", "text": "过去常常把所有东西都混在一起做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11615.99, "timestamp": "03:13:35", "text": "就像2D 3D 嗯，滑溜溜的，我不知道是什么样的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11620.07, "timestamp": "03:13:40", "text": "但是后来，嗯，我就想，好吧，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11622.07, "timestamp": "03:13:42", "text": "我真的很想制作一个3D模型。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11624.15, "timestamp": "03:13:44", "text": "给自己当模特，因为最初我曾经是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11628.309, "timestamp": "03:13:48", "text": "像个虚空主播一样，嗯嗯，但是我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11631.269, "timestamp": "03:13:51", "text": "想为……做些特别的事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11632.87, "timestamp": "03:13:52", "text": "我玩的第一款游戏，虽然不是第一款。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11634.63, "timestamp": "03:13:54", "text": "我玩过的游戏，但就像我玩的第一款游戏一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11635.91, "timestamp": "03:13:55", "text": "非常兴奋能在直播中玩游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11639.11, "timestamp": "03:13:59", "text": "那就是《如龙0》，而我当时"}]